WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.713
Ranking functions should be chosen from the tie rule
If you need exactly

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:11.455
two rows ROW_NUMBER is appropriate If tied
second-place

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:17.150
employees should all be included RANK fits better If
you want compact

00:00:17.176 --> 00:00:22.917
rank levels without gaps use DENSE_RANK The business
meaning

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.733
of ties determines the function
